      "title": "COSE: Fix COSE_Key issue and include latest algorithms from IANA",
      "message": "COSE: Fix COSE_Key issue and include latest algorithms from IANA\n\nThis fixes issue #20847 for COSE_Key dissection.\nThis adds current IANA-registered algorithms and header parameters.\nThis also adds key type headers for WalnutDSA and AKP.\n",
